  bedrooms = 2,
  hook_line = 'A rare resale villa in a fully sold-out Vianaar community, with a private pool and skylights.',
  summary = 'Rare resale opportunity at a fully sold-out Vianaar development in Siolim — a 2BHK villa with Indo-Portuguese architecture, a private pool and garden, minutes from Morjim Beach.',
  description = 'An exclusive opportunity to own a beautifully designed villa in La Luciana, a fully sold-out development by Vianaar — one of North Goa''s most sought-after luxury developers known for timeless Indo-Portuguese architecture and serene low-density communities.

Nestled in a lush gated enclave in Siolim, this charming 2BHK villa blends classic Goan aesthetics with modern comfort. Thoughtfully planned with airy interiors, skylights, and seamless indoor-outdoor living, the home offers the peaceful lifestyle that has made Vianaar projects so highly desirable.

What makes this opportunity especially valuable is its rarity — La Luciana is completely sold out by the developer, with very limited resale inventory ever entering the market. The villa comes with its own private pool and garden, creating a private tropical retreat ideal for both personal use and high-demand holiday rentals.

Peaceful yet well connected — located just minutes from Morjim Beach and close to some of North Goa''s most loved dining destinations including Suzie''s and Sublime.',
  highlights = '114 sqm carpet, 187 sqm SBUA, 110 sqm private garden, private pool, skylights, gated enclave, near Morjim Beach',
