  hook_line = 'A rare corner-unit resale in a sold-out Vianaar development, with paddy field views and a private garden.',
  summary = 'Rare resale corner apartment in a fully sold-out Vianaar development in Nerul, with open paddy field views, a private plunge pool and an exceptionally large private garden.',
  description = 'Set against uninterrupted paddy field views in one of Nerul''s most sought-after boutique developments by Vianaar, this rare resale apartment offers a lifestyle that is increasingly difficult to find in North Goa.

Positioned as a premium corner unit, the apartment opens out to expansive green fields that create a sense of privacy, openness, and calm rarely available in today''s market. The serene paddy views become the centerpiece of the home — bringing in natural light, cross ventilation, and a peaceful atmosphere throughout the year.

What makes this opportunity especially unique is that the entire project is fully sold out, making resale inventory extremely limited and highly desirable. The apartment features its own private plunge pool and an exceptionally large private garden, seamlessly blending indoor comfort with outdoor living.

Boutique development with only 40 residences, premium architecture by Vianaar, a 45-ft common swimming pool, ground + 4 floors, prime Nerul location near Candolim & Coco Beach. Possession by February 2027. RERA: PRGO11232113.',
  highlights = '92.4 sqm carpet, 125.4 sqm built-up, 144 sqm private garden, corner unit, private plunge pool, possession Feb 2027',
