('Exclusive 3BHK Residence in Vagator, North Goa', 'exclusive-3bhk-residence-in-vagator-north-goa', 'New Listing', 'Vagator, North Goa', 'Villa', 'Available', true, 'Get in Touch', NULL, NULL, NULL, 3, 'An exclusive 3BHK residence in a premium gated community, minutes from Vagator Beach.', 'Exclusive 3BHK residence in a premium gated community in Vagator, close to the beach, cafés and nightlife — strong Airbnb and rental potential.', 'Discover refined living in the heart of Vagator with this exclusive 3BHK residence set within a premium gated community in North Goa. Designed for those seeking a blend of luxury, privacy, and investment potential, the home offers contemporary architecture, elegant interiors, and seamless access to Goa''s most vibrant lifestyle destinations.

Perfectly positioned just minutes from Vagator Beach, renowned cafés, fine dining restaurants, boutique nightlife venues, and wellness spaces, this residence presents an exceptional opportunity for both personal use and high-performing Airbnb investment returns.', 'Gated community, spacious 3BHK layout, excellent Airbnb potential, close to beaches and nightlife', NULL, 'https://static.wixstatic.com/media/8dd0f1_69d3b070c47b4f288152d1797e71e66f~mv2.jpeg/v1/fill/w_1280,h_960,al_c/8dd0f1_69d3b070c47b4f288152d1797e71e66f~mv2.jpeg', 'https://static.wixstatic.com/media/8dd0f1_69d3b070c47b4f288152d1797e71e66f~mv2.jpeg/v1/fill/w_1280,h_960,al_c/8dd0f1_69d3b070c47b4f288152d1797e71e66f~mv2.jpeg', ARRAY['https://static.wixstatic.com/media/8dd0f1_69d3b070c47b4f288152d1797e71e66f~mv2.jpeg/v1/fill/w_1280,h_960,al_c/8dd0f1_69d3b070c47b4f288152d1797e71e66f~mv2.jpeg','https://static.wixstatic.com/media/8dd0f1_5540df5af32e49389d5d7fbf1380d7af~mv2.jpeg/v1/fill/w_1280,h_959,al_c/8dd0f1_5540df5af32e49389d5d7fbf1380d7af~mv2.jpeg','https://static.wixstatic.com/media/8dd0f1_fe298b44820245bcbbd4c0ab58c18d32~mv2.jpeg/v1/fill/w_1280,h_960,al_c/8dd0f1_fe298b44820245bcbbd4c0ab58c18d32~mv2.jpeg','https://static.wixstatic.com/media/8dd0f1_c24a729e9023471a9627a71de61d7229~mv2.jpeg/v1/fill/w_1280,h_959,al_c/8dd0f1_c24a729e9023471a9627a71de61d7229~mv2.jpeg','https://static.wixstatic.com/media/8dd0f1_f777e7bfb14242b484a0f02de4415061~mv2.jpeg/v1/fill/w_1280,h_959,al_c/8dd0f1_f777e7bfb14242b484a0f02de4415061~mv2.jpeg','https://static.wixstatic.com/media/8dd0f1_517434ba785446899cb0720fc48f7e99~mv2.jpeg/v1/fill/w_1280,h_960,al_c/8dd0f1_517434ba785446899cb0720fc48f7e99~mv2.jpeg','https://static.wixstatic.com/media/8dd0f1_d3779a8f59ed41a8ac6d0ac760c7a632~mv2.jpeg/v1/fill/w_1280,h_959,al_c/8dd0f1_d3779a8f59ed41a8ac6d0ac760c7a632~mv2.jpeg']::text[], true, 10, true),
('A Sanctuary of Elegance in Assagao', 'a-sanctuary-of-elegance-in-assagao', 'Boutique Collection', 'Assagao, North Goa', 'Villa', 'Available', true, 'Get in Touch', NULL, NULL, NULL, 5, 'Two exquisite five-bedroom villas with private pools, in the heart of Assagao.', 'Two exquisite five-bedroom villas in Assagao with timeless architecture, lush tropical landscaping and private pools — fully furnished and ready to move in.', 'Discover two exquisite five-bedroom villas that redefine luxury living in the heart of Assagao. Designed with timeless architecture, lush tropical landscaping, and private pools, each residence offers a serene retreat that invites you to unwind in style.

From expansive decks to thoughtfully designed interiors, these homes seamlessly blend modern comfort with the charm of one of Goa''s most sought-after neighborhoods. Fully furnished and ready to move in, they are the perfect balance of sophistication and relaxation.

Configuration: 5 Bedrooms | 6 Bathrooms | Private Pool | Fully Furnished. Brokerage applicable.', '5 bedrooms, 6 bathrooms, private pool, fully furnished, Assagao location', NULL, 'https://static.wixstatic.com/media/8dd0f1_a91fc6c96b064aebb423df28ee35190f~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_4000,h_2250,al_c/8dd0f1_a91fc6c96b064aebb423df28ee35190f~mv2.jpg', 'https://static.wixstatic.com/media/8dd0f1_a91fc6c96b064aebb423df28ee35190f~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_4000,h_2250,al_c/8dd0f1_a91fc6c96b064aebb423df28ee35190f~mv2.jpg', ARRAY['https://static.wixstatic.com/media/8dd0f1_a91fc6c96b064aebb423df28ee35190f~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_4000,h_2250,al_c/8dd0f1_a91fc6c96b064aebb423df28ee35190f~mv2.jpg','https://static.wixstatic.com/media/8dd0f1_3b70df9efdc5452c98ed1ed888600d20~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_4000,h_2250,al_c/8dd0f1_3b70df9efdc5452c98ed1ed888600d20~mv2.jpg','https://static.wixstatic.com/media/8dd0f1_6cb2de234cd444f587a669644200b98e~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_4000,h_2250,al_c/8dd0f1_6cb2de234cd444f587a669644200b98e~mv2.jpg','https://static.wixstatic.com/media/8dd0f1_1eca05120e6f4be78f3363ed819c12df~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_4000,h_2250,al_c/8dd0f1_1eca05120e6f4be78f3363ed819c12df~mv2.jpg']::text[], true, 20, true),
('3BHK Apartment in Dona Paula, North Goa', '3bhk-apartment-in-dona-paula-north-goa', NULL, 'Dona Paula, North Goa', 'Apartment', 'Available', true, 'Get in Touch', NULL, NULL, NULL, 3, 'An elegant 3BHK apartment with panoramic sea and field views in Dona Paula.', 'Elegant 3BHK apartment in one of Dona Paula''s most sought-after enclaves, with panoramic sea and field views and ample covered parking.', 'Discover refined coastal living in this elegant 3BHK apartment located in one of Dona Paula''s most sought-after residential enclaves. Thoughtfully designed to offer a perfect blend of comfort, space, and scenic beauty, the home features panoramic sea and field views, sophisticated interiors, and ample covered parking for multiple cars.

Fully furnished and situated in a well-maintained building with a lift, this residence presents a rare opportunity to own a stylish and serene home in one of Goa''s most exclusive neighbourhoods — ideal for both end-use and investment.', 'Sea and field views, fully furnished, lift, covered parking', NULL, 'https://static.wixstatic.com/media/8dd0f1_99f6e90712fd481b9b8cde7e1c2381ca~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_960,h_1280,al_c/8dd0f1_99f6e90712fd481b9b8cde7e1c2381ca~mv2.jpg', 'https://static.wixstatic.com/media/8dd0f1_99f6e90712fd481b9b8cde7e1c2381ca~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_960,h_1280,al_c/8dd0f1_99f6e90712fd481b9b8cde7e1c2381ca~mv2.jpg', ARRAY['https://static.wixstatic.com/media/8dd0f1_99f6e90712fd481b9b8cde7e1c2381ca~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_960,h_1280,al_c/8dd0f1_99f6e90712fd481b9b8cde7e1c2381ca~mv2.jpg','https://static.wixstatic.com/media/8dd0f1_7d5617b4603e43359f3d05990f8e179a~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_960,h_1280,al_c/8dd0f1_7d5617b4603e43359f3d05990f8e179a~mv2.jpg','https://static.wixstatic.com/media/8dd0f1_043511d2d119444ab9c329f6c92bb1e7~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_960,h_1280,al_c/8dd0f1_043511d2d119444ab9c329f6c92bb1e7~mv2.jpg']::text[], true, 30, true),
('Nerul Duplex Penthouse', 'nerul-duplex-penthouse', 'Airbnb Permitted', 'Nerul, North Goa', 'Penthouse', 'Available', true, 'Get in Touch', '360 sqm (duplex)', NULL, NULL, 4, 'An Airbnb-permitted 4BHK duplex penthouse with a private jacuzzi and field views.', 'Airbnb-permitted 4BHK duplex penthouse in Nerul with a private jacuzzi, full generator backup and field views — minutes from Candolim Beach.', 'Discover a rare investment opportunity in North Goa with this Airbnb-permitted 4BHK duplex penthouse — a property designed for high returns and long-term value.

Built-up area of 360 sqm across a duplex layout, with a private jacuzzi and full generator backup. Located 5 minutes to Candolim Beach & Tereza Beach House, 1 km from Coco Beach, and 2.5 km from Reis Magos Fort — surrounded by upscale dining, beaches, and tourist hotspots.

With its combination of location, amenities, and Airbnb approval, this penthouse offers exceptional rental yields and consistent occupancy.', 'Airbnb permitted, private jacuzzi, 360 sqm duplex, full generator backup, field views', NULL, 'https://static.wixstatic.com/media/8dd0f1_4032583ccf1c4ff0a9d1d2d54be7709f~mv2.jpeg/v1/fill/w_6267,h_4178,al_c/8dd0f1_4032583ccf1c4ff0a9d1d2d54be7709f~mv2.jpeg', 'https://static.wixstatic.com/media/8dd0f1_4032583ccf1c4ff0a9d1d2d54be7709f~mv2.jpeg/v1/fill/w_6267,h_4178,al_c/8dd0f1_4032583ccf1c4ff0a9d1d2d54be7709f~mv2.jpeg', ARRAY['https://static.wixstatic.com/media/8dd0f1_4032583ccf1c4ff0a9d1d2d54be7709f~mv2.jpeg/v1/fill/w_6267,h_4178,al_c/8dd0f1_4032583ccf1c4ff0a9d1d2d54be7709f~mv2.jpeg','https://static.wixstatic.com/media/8dd0f1_1f5239c33288412a83f054aac3b6a5e5~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_1206,h_1193,al_c/8dd0f1_1f5239c33288412a83f054aac3b6a5e5~mv2.jpg','https://static.wixstatic.com/media/8dd0f1_39999e66e4a142b5a72e5fd4c7c7a34c~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_1206,h_909,al_c/8dd0f1_39999e66e4a142b5a72e5fd4c7c7a34c~mv2.jpg','https://static.wixstatic.com/media/8dd0f1_efd65e30d4044769a442455dfc62c9fb~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_1206,h_784,al_c/8dd0f1_efd65e30d4044769a442455dfc62c9fb~mv2.jpg','https://static.wixstatic.com/media/8dd0f1_3e4fee6af9274082a288b0502dfc72cd~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_1206,h_797,al_c/8dd0f1_3e4fee6af9274082a288b0502dfc72cd~mv2.jpg','https://static.wixstatic.com/media/8dd0f1_b861d0ba0405416480acdb72164d54d8~mv2.jpeg/v1/fill/w_4162,h_6243,al_c/8dd0f1_b861d0ba0405416480acdb72164d54d8~mv2.jpeg']::text[], true, 40, true),
('Ribandar Sea View', 'ribandar-sea-view', NULL, 'Ribandar, Panjim', 'Apartment', 'Available', true, 'Get in Touch', NULL, NULL, NULL, 4, 'A luxury 4BHK apartment with sweeping Mandovi River views in Ribandar.', 'Luxury four-bedroom apartment in Ribandar with sweeping Mandovi River views, within Panjim Municipality limits, and resort-style amenities.', 'This luxury four-bedroom apartment in Ribandar offers an unmatched lifestyle with sweeping views of the Mandovi River. Situated within the Panjim Municipality limits, it provides the rare advantage of living close to the city while enjoying the calm and beauty of waterfront surroundings.

Large windows and an expansive balcony open up to uninterrupted river views. Residents can enjoy a host of high-end amenities including swimming pools, an exclusive clubhouse, a fully equipped gym, and recreational spaces, plus basement parking and reliable water supply from Panjim PWD.', 'Mandovi River views, clubhouse, gym, swimming pools, basement parking', NULL, 'https://static.wixstatic.com/media/8dd0f1_d642ba610d404f8d917e8a03c38bde9b~mv2.jpeg/v1/fill/w_5712,h_4284,al_c/8dd0f1_d642ba610d404f8d917e8a03c38bde9b~mv2.jpeg', 'https://static.wixstatic.com/media/8dd0f1_d642ba610d404f8d917e8a03c38bde9b~mv2.jpeg/v1/fill/w_5712,h_4284,al_c/8dd0f1_d642ba610d404f8d917e8a03c38bde9b~mv2.jpeg', ARRAY['https://static.wixstatic.com/media/8dd0f1_d642ba610d404f8d917e8a03c38bde9b~mv2.jpeg/v1/fill/w_5712,h_4284,al_c/8dd0f1_d642ba610d404f8d917e8a03c38bde9b~mv2.jpeg','https://static.wixstatic.com/media/8dd0f1_8983bdce0f4d42f5bcd61c805a079785~mv2.jpeg/v1/fill/w_4032,h_3024,al_c/8dd0f1_8983bdce0f4d42f5bcd61c805a079785~mv2.jpeg','https://static.wixstatic.com/media/8dd0f1_2e26626be79d46cd814436982ce10352~mv2.jpeg/v1/fill/w_4032,h_3024,al_c/8dd0f1_2e26626be79d46cd814436982ce10352~mv2.jpeg','https://static.wixstatic.com/media/8dd0f1_b3a81063dc4b49ad98bf47be44beba1e~mv2.jpeg/v1/fill/w_3024,h_4032,al_c/8dd0f1_b3a81063dc4b49ad98bf47be44beba1e~mv2.jpeg']::text[], true, 50, true),
('Luxury 4BHK Villa with Pool & Jacuzzi – Socorro, North Goa', 'luxury-4bhk-villa-with-pool-jacuzzi-socorro-north-goa', NULL, 'Socorro, North Goa', 'Villa', 'Available', false, '₹9 Cr (Negotiable)', '328 sqm', NULL, '405 sqm', 4, 'A standalone 4BHK villa with a private pool and jacuzzi on a 405 sqm plot in Socorro.', 'Standalone 4BHK villa in Socorro on a 405 sqm plot with a private pool and jacuzzi, servant''s quarters and parking for 3 cars.', 'Experience refined living in this spacious standalone villa located in the serene and well-connected neighborhood of Socorro, North Goa. Designed for comfort, privacy, and effortless entertaining, this elegant home offers generous indoor spaces complemented by premium outdoor amenities.

