('Dona Paula Smart Villa', 'dona-paula-smart-villa', 'Twin Villa', 'Dona Paula, North Goa', 'Villa', 'Available', false, '₹6.50 Cr', NULL, NULL, '193 sqm', 4, 'A smart, tech-enabled 4BHK multi-level home just 5 minutes from Panaji.', 'Intelligently designed 4BHK multi-level smart home near Dona Paula, 5 minutes from Panaji, with a private hydraulic elevator and full home automation.', 'Just 5 minutes from Panaji, this intelligently designed multi-level home offers seamless connectivity to both North and South Goa via the highway — while being tucked away in a quiet, prime residential neighborhood.

