('Luxury Siolim Villas', 'luxury-siolim-villas', 'Boutique Collection', 'Siolim, North Goa', 'Villa', 'Available', false, 'From ₹7.5 Cr', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'A collection of three luxury villas — Sage, Saffron and Jasmine — in North Goa.', 'An exclusive collection of three luxury villas (Sage ₹7.5 Cr, Saffron ₹8.5 Cr, Jasmine ₹8.5 Cr) in North Goa, each with a private pool and gated setting.', 'Discover an exclusive collection of luxury villas designed for elevated living in the heart of North Goa. Blending contemporary architecture with tropical elegance, these residences offer expansive interiors, private leisure spaces, and premium finishes.

