('The Nagoa Villas', 'the-nagoa-villas', 'Luxury Villa', 'Nagoa, North Goa', 'Villa', 'Available', false, '₹10.50 Cr', '~6,000 sq.ft', NULL, NULL, 5, 'A villa amid Goa''s paddy fields with a private infinity pool, minutes from Anjuna and Candolim.', 'Villa in Nagoa spread across ~6,000 sq.ft with 4–5 bedrooms, double-height living areas and a private infinity pool overlooking paddy fields.', 'Discover refined living amidst Goa''s lush paddy fields. This exceptional villa in Nagoa, North Goa, offers an exquisite balance of luxury, privacy, and natural beauty.

