('Reis Magos Sea View Villa', 'reis-magos-sea-view-villa', NULL, 'Reis Magos, North Goa', 'Villa', 'Available', true, 'Get in Touch', '481 sqm', NULL, '794 sqm', 4, 'A standalone villa with uninterrupted, forever sea views in Reis Magos.', 'Standalone 4BHK villa in Reis Magos on a 794 sqm plot with uninterrupted forever sea views, a media room and a pool deck onto a landscaped garden.', 'Nestled in the tranquil village of Reis Magos, this standalone villa offers uninterrupted, forever sea views with the assurance that no future construction will ever obstruct its breathtaking panorama. Just ten minutes from Candolim.

Each of the four spacious bedrooms comes with its own en-suite bathroom. A dedicated media room creates the perfect space for private screenings, while the living and dining areas flow onto the pool deck and landscaped garden. Includes separate staff quarters, a driver''s room, and parking for up to four cars, within a premium gated enclave with 24/7 security.

