('The Guirim Villa', 'the-guirim-villa', 'New Launch', 'Guirim, North Goa', 'Villa', 'Available', true, 'Get in Touch', NULL, NULL, NULL, 4, 'A luxury retreat with an infinity-style pool over Goa''s changing paddy field landscapes.', 'A four-bedroom villa in Guirim with uninterrupted paddy field views and an infinity-style pool that extends along the edge of the fields.', 'Nestled in the heart of North Goa, this four-bedroom villa presents a rare blend of serenity and convenience, with beaches, renowned restaurants, and vibrant hotspots just minutes away.

Designed to harmonize with its natural surroundings, the villa offers uninterrupted views of expansive paddy fields that transform beautifully through the seasons. An infinity-style pool extends along the edge of these fields, creating a seamless connection between indoor and outdoor living.

Inside, spacious layouts and elegant design come together to create an inviting retreat, with interiors flowing effortlessly into open sit-outs and terraces.', '4BHK, infinity-style pool, paddy field views, North Goa', 'March 2025', 'https://static.wixstatic.com/media/8dd0f1_8d8a7048f0274699bc680d45191ad95c~mv2.jpeg/v1/fill/w_2560,h_1705,al_c/8dd0f1_8d8a7048f0274699bc680d45191ad95c~mv2.jpeg', 'https://static.wixstatic.com/media/8dd0f1_8d8a7048f0274699bc680d45191ad95c~mv2.jpeg/v1/fill/w_2560,h_1705,al_c/8dd0f1_8d8a7048f0274699bc680d45191ad95c~mv2.jpeg', ARRAY['https://static.wixstatic.com/media/8dd0f1_8d8a7048f0274699bc680d45191ad95c~mv2.jpeg/v1/fill/w_2560,h_1705,al_c/8dd0f1_8d8a7048f0274699bc680d45191ad95c~mv2.jpeg','https://static.wixstatic.com/media/8dd0f1_2df834ec3acf4e04b8e53096f8220e22~mv2.jpeg/v1/fill/w_2560,h_1705,al_c/8dd0f1_2df834ec3acf4e04b8e53096f8220e22~mv2.jpeg','https://static.wixstatic.com/media/8dd0f1_c3829bfe83114c1f9144f942b6a8ffbe~mv2.jpeg/v1/fill/w_2560,h_1705,al_c/8dd0f1_c3829bfe83114c1f9144f942b6a8ffbe~mv2.jpeg','https://static.wixstatic.com/media/8dd0f1_1fbf4b2ce9454546961ed45583a07067~mv2.jpeg/v1/fill/w_2560,h_1707,al_c/8dd0f1_1fbf4b2ce9454546961ed45583a07067~mv2.jpeg','https://static.wixstatic.com/media/8dd0f1_3adff15bd984439fbe5e0dc3f6d0fe80~mv2.jpeg/v1/fill/w_3024,h_4032,al_c/8dd0f1_3adff15bd984439fbe5e0dc3f6d0fe80~mv2.jpeg']::text[], true, 130, true),
('Sangolda Penthouse', 'sangolda-penthouse', NULL, 'Porvorim, North Goa', 'Penthouse', 'Available', true, 'Get in Touch', '250 sqm', NULL, NULL, 3, 'A 3BHK penthouse with a 110 sqm terrace and gazebo, and a 90 sqm garage.', 'Spacious 3BHK penthouse in Porvorim with 250 sqm of living space, high ceilings, three en-suite bedrooms, and an expansive 110 sqm terrace with a gazebo.', 'For sale in Porvorim — a spacious 3BHK apartment offering 250 sqm of thoughtfully designed living space with high ceilings and abundant natural light. The home features three en-suite bedrooms, a powder room, two kitchens, and a large living and dining area, complemented by a second living room or office overlooking lush greenery.

