('Luxury Villa for Sale – Nerul, North Goa', 'luxury-villa-for-sale-nerul-north-goa', NULL, 'Nerul, North Goa', 'Villa', 'Available', true, 'Get in Touch', '292 sqm', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The final villa remaining in an intimate gated enclave of just seven independent villas.', 'A rare opportunity to own the final residence in an intimate gated enclave of just seven independent villas in Nerul, with a private pool and landscaped garden.', 'A rare opportunity to own the final residence in an intimate enclave of just seven independent villas, this beautifully crafted home in Nerul embodies understated luxury, privacy, and refined living.

