('Aldeia De Goa', 'aldeia-de-goa', NULL, 'Bambolim, North Goa', 'Villa', 'Available', true, 'Get in Touch', NULL, NULL, NULL, 4, 'A 4BHK villa under development with a private 9-metre pool in the exclusive Aldeia de Goa community.', 'Luxury 4BHK villa under development in the exclusive Aldeia de Goa community in Bambolim, with a private 9-metre pool and a double-height entertainment room.', 'A luxury 4BHK villa is under development in the exclusive community of Aldeia de Goa, with expected completion in March 2026. Designed for refined living, the villa features a private 9-metre pool, landscaped garden, and spacious living and dining areas that overlook the poolside.

