('Villa Santana', 'villa-santana', NULL, 'North Goa', 'Villa', 'Available', true, 'Get in Touch', NULL, '480 sqm', '800 sqm', 4, 'A beautifully restored Portuguese heritage villa with a private pool and jacuzzi.', 'Beautifully restored Portuguese heritage villa on an 800 sqm plot, with four en-suite bedrooms, a private pool, jacuzzi and landscaped garden.', 'For sale in North Goa — a beautifully restored Portuguese heritage villa that blends timeless architecture with modern comforts. Set on an 800 sqm plot with a super built-up area of 480 sqm, the home features four en-suite bedrooms and a powder room, along with spacious living and dining areas ideal for entertaining.

The property includes a main kitchen with an additional dry kitchen, a maid''s room, and a charming gazebo overlooking the landscaped garden. Equipped with a private swimming pool, jacuzzi, solar water heating, full lighting and AC systems, and a backup genset with pumps.', 'Portuguese heritage architecture, private pool & jacuzzi, gazebo, solar water heating', NULL, 'https://static.wixstatic.com/media/8dd0f1_c5c63589986b4581bd30fbbf00ba9bb6~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_960,h_1280,al_c/8dd0f1_c5c63589986b4581bd30fbbf00ba9bb6~mv2.jpg', 'https://static.wixstatic.com/media/8dd0f1_c5c63589986b4581bd30fbbf00ba9bb6~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_960,h_1280,al_c/8dd0f1_c5c63589986b4581bd30fbbf00ba9bb6~mv2.jpg', ARRAY['https://static.wixstatic.com/media/8dd0f1_c5c63589986b4581bd30fbbf00ba9bb6~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_960,h_1280,al_c/8dd0f1_c5c63589986b4581bd30fbbf00ba9bb6~mv2.jpg','https://static.wixstatic.com/media/8dd0f1_3ee275a268a44be793ba57928d11c231~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_960,h_1280,al_c/8dd0f1_3ee275a268a44be793ba57928d11c231~mv2.jpg','https://static.wixstatic.com/media/8dd0f1_6ef053569f7f47d6a542abf1e6b5bb5a~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_960,h_1280,al_c/8dd0f1_6ef053569f7f47d6a542abf1e6b5bb5a~mv2.jpg']::text[], true, 210, true),
('The Assagao Villas', 'the-assagao-villas', 'Gated Community', 'Assagao, North Goa', 'Villa', 'Available', true, 'Get in Touch', NULL, NULL, NULL, 5, 'Limited-edition 4 & 5 bedroom villas with private pools and a private elevator in Assagao.', 'Limited-edition villas in Assagao with 4 and 5 en-suite bedrooms, private pools, landscaped gardens and a private elevator.', 'Experience the charm of Goa''s most exclusive neighborhood with these limited-edition villas in Assagao — where timeless architecture meets modern sophistication. Each residence is a serene retreat surrounded by lush greenery and the region''s most celebrated cafés and boutiques.

Spanning across spacious layouts, these villas feature 4 and 5 ensuite bedrooms, private swimming pools, landscaped gardens, and elegant living spaces bathed in natural light. Thoughtfully planned interiors are complemented by a private elevator, staff quarters, and an optional home automation system.

